<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender 30,000 tonnes US corn/soy.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender 30,000 tonnes US corn/soy.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender on Friday for a combined shipment of 25,000 tonnes of U.S. corn and 5,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans, local traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>	   Tonnage	 U.S. Gulf	 Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>Corn     25,000	 March 1-15	 March 16-31</p>
<p>Soybeans  5,000	 March 1-15	 March 16-31</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
